---

This repository bundles, as build-time Claude Code plugin marketplaces,
forks of third-party projects maintained separately under the fibtecltd
GitHub organisation:

  - fibtecltd/claude-workflows        (fork of wshobson/agents)
  - fibtecltd/python-backend-plugins  (fork of ruslan-korneev/python-backend-claude-plugins)
  - fibtecltd/claude-skills           (fork of alirezarezvani/claude-skills)

Each fork retains its own upstream license. This LICENSE file covers only
the claude-docker-public repository's own content (Dockerfile, compose
files, scripts, and the claude-backup/ configuration bundle).
